# Docker reads this from the build context, which is the repository root.
#
# Docker patterns do not cross a slash, so `*.md` and `*.html` exclude the
# noisy files at the root only. application/index.html and the kit's README
# are inside COPY'd directories and stay in the image.
.git
logs
*.md
*.html
**/__pycache__
**/.cache
**/.env
**/usage.jsonl
